      "html": "<div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#14171e;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:10px\">\n<div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#d9a441;font-family:monospace\">五路周期投票 · 主判=冰点·降</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9\">①竞价 <span style=\"color:#4caf7d\">同意</span><br><b style=\"color:#d8dee9\">冰点·平</b><br><span style=\"color:#5c6674\">权41%·准确率8/22</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9\">②席位 <span style=\"color:#4caf7d\">同意</span><br><b style=\"color:#d8dee9\">冰点·降</b><br><span style=\"color:#5c6674\">权34%·准确率6/22</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9\">③题材 <span style=\"color:#4caf7d\">同意</span><br><b style=\"color:#d8dee9\">冰点·降</b><br><span style=\"color:#5c6674\">权40%·准确率7/20</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e05d5d;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9\">④产逻 <span style=\"color:#e05d5d\">反对</span><br><b style=\"color:#e05d5d\">退潮·降</b><br><span style=\"color:#5c6674\">权47%·准确率10/22</span></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9\">⑤质量 <span style=\"color:#4caf7d\">同意</span><br><b style=\"color:#d8dee9\">冰点·平</b><br><span style=\"color:#5c6674\">权38%·准确率7/22</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;color:#5c6674;font-size:11px\">分歧未达阈值(当日≥3/5或加权≥0.60复议;连续3日≥2路同向重做) · 次日A档三指标Δ客观结算,准确率定话语权 · ★一致率长期>0.8=回声室警示(evidence须私有数据)</div>\n</div>",
